sequenceDiagram
participant TX as Domain Transaction
participant DB as PostgreSQL
participant OUT as Outbox
participant PUB as Publisher
participant MQ as Broker
participant C as Consumer
participant DLQ as Dead Letter Queue
TX->>DB: Persist authoritative state
TX->>OUT: Persist event
Note over DB,OUT: Atomic transaction
PUB->>OUT: Read unpublished event
OUT-->>PUB: Event
PUB->>MQ: Publish
PUB->>OUT: Mark published
MQ->>C: Deliver
C->>C: Idempotency check
alt Success
C-->>MQ: ACK
else Transient failure
C->>C: Retry with backoff + jitter
else Permanent failure
C->>DLQ: Isolate failed event
C-->>MQ: ACK / isolate
end
Note over MQ,C: At-least-once delivery.
